# Design system

All UI goes through `components/ui` and CSS variables in `packages/tokens`.

- Do not hardcode hex, px radii, or font families in pages or components.
- Use semantic tokens (`--color-accent`, `--color-text`, `--radius-md`, `--font-sans`).
- Prefer `Button`, `Field`, `Input`, `Select`, `Card`, `Panel`, `Page`, `Nav`, `Table`, `Alert`.
- Class prefix is `ds-`.
- When the parent-company Claude Design system is ready, map it in `packages/tokens/brand.override.css` — do not restyle individual screens.
- Per-lab color is `data-brand` + `packages/tokens/brands.css` only.
